<div class="container" style="padding-bottom:64px">
  <div class="split" style="padding:40px 0">
    <div class="prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
      <h1><%= settings.store_name %>: <%= settings.tagline %></h1>
      <p><i>Ojas</i> is a Sanskrit word for vitality and radiant energy. It's the feeling we want you to carry into every workout, every walk and every day.</p>
      <p>We design activewear for women that moves with you: supportive sports bras, smooth high-waist leggings, tennis skirts and skorts, layering jackets and easy everyday tops. Our fabrics are soft, stretchy blends of polyester or nylon with elastane, available in a wide palette of colours and in sizes from XS to XXXL across most styles.</p>
      <h2>What we care about</h2>
      <ul><li><b>Comfort first.</b> Stretch fabrics and flattering cuts that feel good all day.</li><li><b>Range of sizes.</b> Activewear for every body.</li><li><b>Simple, honest shopping.</b> Clear prices, easy returns and real people on the other end of the phone.</li></ul>
      <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/shop">Shop the collection</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact">Get in touch</a></div>
    </div>
    <img src="/img/logo-full.png" alt="<%= settings.store_name %> logo" style="object-fit:contain;background:#fff;padding:40px;aspect-ratio:1">
  </div>
</div>
